2026-08-16T02:29:25.3314942Z [36;1m# the rcc R-devel job has produced build failures. Skip the persistent[0m
2026-08-16T02:29:25.3315427Z [36;1m# cache there and build cold; ccache itself stays configured by the[0m
2026-08-16T02:29:25.3315858Z [36;1m# install action, so reuse within the job is unaffected.[0m
2026-08-16T02:29:25.3316174Z [36;1m#[0m
2026-08-16T02:29:25.3316481Z [36;1m# R.version$status is empty for a released R and non-empty for one that[0m
